 SEC under \"Services-Computer Programming, Data Processing, Etc.\", based in NY, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $2.1bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, down 12.2% against the same quarter a year earlier.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($156.0m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $156.0m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800227/000180022724000024/0001800227-24-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001800227-24-000024"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-6.7% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800227/000162828026029798/0001628280-26-029798-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-029798"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 12.2% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800227/000162828026029798/0001628280-26-029798-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-029798"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-9.5% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800227/000162828026029798/0001628280-26-029798-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-029798"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $64.2m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800227/000162828026029798/0001628280-26-029798-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-029798"},{"text":"Officers and direct